aker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_35","text":"Do you think going in the water would help?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_36","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_37","text":"I mean, if you're wearing a swimsuit, it only makes sense to take a dip.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_38","text":"I get it now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_39","text":"You're saying I have to fill these empty clothes with water!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_40","text":"Master, you never disappoint.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_41","text":"I will always be your faithful disciple,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_42","text":"not just when it comes to firepower,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_43","text":"but to waterpower as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_44","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_44","text":"You don't have to do that...","jump":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_46"},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_45","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_45","text":"You can always think of me as your master.","jump":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_48"},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_46","text":"What do you mean?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_47","text":"Once a master, always a master!","jump":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_49"},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_48","text":"Yes, Master!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_49","text":"All right then,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_50","text":"I'll see you soon whenever I've got any new conundrums.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neon_blueocean_01_51","text":"Waterpower, waterpower!","jump":null}],"chat":true}